## Context Flow Diagram

```
[saludo] → [Usuario elige opción]
                ↓
    ┌──────────┴──────────┐
    ↓                     ↓
[faq_*]              [cita_iniciar]
(sin contexto)            ↓
                  [cita_seleccion_tipo]
                    ↓           ↓
              [local]       [domicilio]
                  ↓              ↓
          [cita_local_*]   [cita_domicilio_*]
                  ↓              ↓
          [confirmar]      [confirmar]
                  ↓              ↓
              [DONE]         [DONE]

[cotizar_iniciar]
        ↓
[cotizacion_tipo]
    ↓         ↓
[producto]  [servicio]
    ↓           ↓
[opciones]  [opciones]
    ↓           ↓
[enviar]    [enviar]
```

## Fallback Escalation Strategy

```
Attempt 1: Standard fallback message
Attempt 2: Offer quick replies with main options
Attempt 3: Offer to connect with human agent
```

```javascript
// Fulfillment logic for escalation
const FALLBACK_COUNT_CONTEXT = 'fallback_count';

const handleFallback = (agent) => {
  const context = agent.getContext(FALLBACK_COUNT_CONTEXT);
  const count = context ? context.parameters.count + 1 : 1;
  
  agent.setContext({
    name: FALLBACK_COUNT_CONTEXT,
    lifespan: 5,
    parameters: { count }
  });
  
  if (count >= 3) {
    agent.add(MESSAGES.ESCALATE_TO_HUMAN);
    agent.clearContext(FALLBACK_COUNT_CONTEXT);
  } else if (count === 2) {
    agent.add(MESSAGES.FALLBACK_WITH_OPTIONS);
  } else {
    agent.add(MESSAGES.FALLBACK_SIMPLE);
  }
};
```